# needs typographic-palette-bar.scm: Format > Colour from the menu bar (col),
# its check box "Typographic palette" checked (on: the Set list and the
# palette in the open menu, which moves up if it no longer fits), then
# unchecked (off: the grid of before). The refresh asked for in the menu
# reaches the editor window (windows_refresh), which no other window opens.
# Positions for the default window of the test home.
wait 6000
window No name
click 231 15
wait 900
move 242 275
wait 1200
snapshot col
move 400 280
wait 300
move 387 454
wait 300
click 387 454
wait 1500
snapshot on
move 387 559
wait 300
click 387 559
wait 1500
snapshot off
